---
// Competition divisions — classification & spec book
---
<section class="py-space-2xl bg-surface border-b-2 border-surface-variant" id="classification-book">
  <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-space-xl border-b-2 border-surface-variant pb-space-md">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg font-headline-lg uppercase text-on-surface mt-space-xs">CLASSIFICATION &amp; SPECIFICATION BOOK <span class="text-primary-container">// 仕様書・分類規定</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-tertiary max-w-md mt-space-sm md:mt-0 font-code-telemetry">All teams compete under a single uniform standard. Volumetric envelopes, autonomous sensor protocols, and blade edge tolerances are strictly codified in the V3.2 manual.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-space-sm mb-space-xl">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low border-2 border-surface-variant p-space-sm">
        <span class="text-label-badge font-label-badge text-tertiary block">STANDARD CLASS</span>
        <span class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-bold">UNIFIED TIER</span>
        <span class="text-label-stamp font-label-stamp text-secondary-container block mt-1">SINGLE UNIFORM DIVISION</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low border-2 border-surface-variant p-space-sm">
        <span class="text-label-badge font-label-badge text-tertiary block">CONTROL PROTOCOL</span>
        <span class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary-container font-bold">100% AUTONOMOUS</span>
        <span class="text-label-stamp font-label-stamp text-tertiary block mt-1">ZERO HUMAN REMOTE CONTROL</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low border-2 border-surface-variant p-space-sm">
        <span class="text-label-badge font-label-badge text-tertiary block">MANUAL CODE</span>
        <span class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-bold">V3.2 SPEC BOOK</span>
        <span class="text-label-stamp font-label-stamp text-error block mt-1">STRICT COMPLIANCE MANDATE</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low border-2 border-surface-variant p-space-sm">
        <span class="text-label-badge font-label-badge text-tertiary block">SPEC BOOK STATUS</span>
        <span class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary-container font-bold">BETA RELEASE</span>
        <span class="text-label-stamp font-label-stamp text-secondary-fixed-dim block mt-1">V3.2 DRAFT UNDER REVIEW</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-surface-container-high border-2 border-primary-container p-space-lg flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-space-lg shadow-hard-red">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-primary-container inline-block"></span>
          <span class="text-label-stamp font-label-stamp text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider">COMPLIANCE DOCUMENTATION // RELEASE 3.2.0-BETA</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-tertiary max-w-2xl">Download the current beta version of the technical specification manual (V3.2-BETA) to verify robot weight, dimensional bounding box, wiring diagrams, and pre-match inspection protocols. Content is still under review and may change before the final release.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-sm shrink-0">
        <a class="btn-brutal whitespace-nowrap bg-primary-container text-accent-ink text-label-stamp font-label-stamp px-space-lg py-space-md border-2 border-on-surface uppercase shadow-hard-black flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-on-primary-container hover:text-accent-ink transition-none" href="#download-spec-book">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">download</span>
          <span>SPEC BOOK · PDF V3.2-BETA</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
